Z||000000||TheFiero64||03-28-2001||05:58 PM||||I was told about this site a while ago. every month they give away a $20 dollar prize for free. I won in Dec. They are great. They asked if I was happy with the service and I didn't even buy anything. I just bought some Lexol for my seats and they shipped the same day. They give you the ups tracking number and all. They have really made an impact on me. They go out of the way for service. I know it costs more because of shipping but I think it is worth it. They have a lifetime guarantee if you are not satisfied.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.Autodetail.com" TARGET=_blank>www.Autodetail.com</A> <P>I have nothing to do with them. I just figured I would spread my happiness.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg"> <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||10
